SUMMARY:Member Holiday Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with us at a Members-only holiday event at the Museum! Gather the family for Happy Feet (2006) and sip on delicious hot cocoa as you enjoy movie. Capture the magic of the evening at our holiday-themed photo booth\, the perfect way to create lasting memories together.  It’s the perfect way to kick off the holidays with your Museum community! \nDoors open at 6pm\, movie starts at 7pm. \nCurrent membership and pre-registration required. Recommended for all ages. Not a member yet? Join today! \nRegister now
