SUMMARY:Creature Connections (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an entertaining and hands-on program exploring the relationship between animals and their natural habitats. Featuring live animal encounters\, this family friendly experience gives guests the opportunity to get up close and connect with ambassador animals. \nNote: Creature Connections occurs monthly on the last Saturday (rescheduled around holidays when possible) at 10:30AM and 1:30PM. Morning and afternoon programs each month are the same\, but program topics vary month-to-month.  \nFor more information\, please call the Museum at Whiteville: 910.788.5100.
